  "description": "Free, open-source (Apache-2.0) MediatR alternative with a MediatR-compatible API: migrate by swapping the package, the namespace and AddMediatR for AddOpenMediatR. Lightweight in-process mediator for .NET supporting requests, streaming requests, notifications, pipeline behaviors, pre/post-processors, exception handlers/actions, and pluggable notification sinks.",
